  "shortdescription" : "Elu'nya & Ael'tiri Statue",
  "description" : "Looks like a floating crescent with little crystal pieces around it, just hovering over the pedestal.",
  "longdescription" : "^#7fe7ff;Elu'nya^reset; is a small decorative sculpture representing the crescent-shaped symbol associated with initial alta astral origins. The inner sphere, known as ^#7fe7ff;Ael'tiri^reset;, is traditionally interpreted as a point of focused ^#7fe7ff;\"dream-light\", while the surrounding crystal fragments symbolize dispersed harmonic energy.\nThis concept is sometimes used in alta interior design as a calm, static reminder of balance between motion and stillness. Despite its dynamic appearance, the piece is entirely solid, created to imitate suspended celestial motion.",
  "altaDescription" : "Elu'nya has always had a calming effect on me. I don't know why. Maybe because the shape doesn't ask for anything — it simply exists. And that alone is enough to make me feel better.",

